---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | RiddlesMaster"
  description="Read the privacy policy for RiddlesMaster to understand how we collect, store, and protect your user data."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-[#141413] max-w-none">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#141413] font-serif mb-6 leading-tight"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm text-[#6c6a64] italic mb-8">
        Last Updated: June 10, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-[#3d3d3a] leading-relaxed text-[15px]">
        <p>
          At RiddlesMaster, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you use our platform.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          1. What Data We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          We collect information to provide a personalized, functional experience on our platform. The types of data we collect include:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Account Information:</strong> When you register, we collect your email address, your name, and your profile picture/avatar.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage & Activity Data:</strong> We track your progress, including which riddles you attempt, complete, or like, as well as your daily solving streak to maintain streak statistics.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          2. Why We Collect It
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use your information solely for the following purposes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>To personalize and secure your user session.</li>
          <li>To save your daily challenge progress, completed puzzles, and solve streaks.</li>
          <li>To process premium upgrades and verify active subscriptions.</li>
          <li>To communicate support alerts, password resets, and streak notifications.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          3. How We Store and Protect Your Data
        </h2>
        <p>
          Your user profile, authentication, and puzzle activity are securely stored in the cloud. We utilize <strong>Supabase</strong>, a secure cloud infrastructure, to host our database. Access controls are strictly managed via Postgres Row-Level Security (RLS) policies to ensure that your private user data cannot be accessed by unauthorized parties.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          4. Third-Party Services
        </h2>
        <p>
          We coordinate with leading, secure third-party services to power core functionalities of our app:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Google OAuth:</strong> To allow single sign-on and authenticate users securely using their Google accounts.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Razorpay:</strong> To process premium subscription payments. RiddlesMaster does not store or process your credit card or financial details directly; all transactions are securely handled by Razorpay.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Resend:</strong> To deliver password reset links, email verifications, and streak reminders.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          5. Your Rights and Data Erasure
        </h2>
        <p>
          You retain full control over your data. You have the right to access your stored profile or request full deletion of your account and progress data. To request account deletion, please email us at <a href="mailto:riddlesmaster00@gmail.com" class="text-[#cc785c] hover:underline">riddlesmaster00@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          6. Contact Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:riddlesmaster00@gmail.com" class="text-[#cc785c] hover:underline">riddlesmaster00@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
